  "skip": {},
  "notes": {
    "tables": "The baseline captures each table as the list of every number in its text. Unit strings (CFC11, Co-60, PM2.5, 1,4-DCB), basis strings (158 t × $10/kg, 12 op + 3 sup) and value-sorted OPEX rows add or move numbers, and the CAPEX capture concatenates cost and share (\"$450,000\" + \"6.0%\" -> 4500006.0), so only the leading run of each table has a uniform stride. The lca_table_body scalar covers the Tris GWP cell; every category total is verified in the model against the dashboard by the lcia_check script in the authoring notes."
  }
}
